<title>USA: Claremont unit acquires stake in Trilan.</title>
<headline>Claremont unit acquires stake in Trilan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Adventure Electronics Inc said Tuesday it sold its 50 percent stake in Communications Informatiques Trilan Canada Inc to a unit of Claremont Technology Group Inc.</p>
<p>All the shares in Trilan held by Adventure Electronics were sold to Claremont Technology Canada Inc, Adventure Electronics said.</p>
<p>It did not detail terms of the transaction.</p>
<p>It said the deal resulted from efforts by Trilan to penetrate the Intranet and Internet markets, concentrating on Web site creation.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1700))</p>
